            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yakuwona, Ŵalakwe AMBUJE Mlungu Ŵamaciligosope, ali ŵakulungwa. Mpela yele yitwapikene ni mapilikanilo getu, pangali soni jwine jwakulandana ni ŵalakwe, soni pangali Mlungu jwine nambo ŵalakwe jika basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana mtundu wapi wa ŵandu ŵa pa cilambo capasi uli ŵakulandana ni Aisalaeli, ŵele ŵalakwe Mlungu ŵakulupwisye ku Iguputo kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵawo? Ŵapikanice pakwatendela yindu yekulungwa ni yakogoya, soni pakwatoposya ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine pamo ni milungu jawo, ndaŵi jele ŵandu ŵenu jiŵajinjilaga mcilambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 4:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwasagwile ŵandu ŵenu Aisalaeli kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵenuŵenupe kwa yaka yosope. Ni ŵalakwe AMBUJE ŵaliji Mlungu jwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambano ŵalakwe AMBUJE Mlungu, acisunje cilanga cawo ciŵatesile pakusala ya une jwakutumicila jwawo ni ya liŵasa lyangu. Atende mpela muŵaŵecetelemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo lina lyenu tiliciŵa lyakucimbicikwa mpaka kalakala. Ŵandu tacitiga kuti, ‘AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope ali Mlungu jwakwalamulila Aisalaeli.’ Myoyo liŵasa lya une Daudi, jwakutumicila jwenu, tilicitamilicika kwa yaka yosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pakuŵa Ŵalakwe, AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, asalile une jwakutumicila jwawo kuti taciwutamilisya ucimwene pa lukosyo lwangu. Ni ligongo lyakwe une jwakutumicila jwawo limbile mtima kusala ali lipopeloli kwa ŵalakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano Ŵalakwe AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope, ali Mlungu, soni maloŵe gawo gali gakuwona. Aŵisile cilanga kuti tacindendela une jwakutumicila jwawo yindu yambone yamtundu welewu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ngwaŵenda kuti alipe upile mwa lukondwa liŵasa lya une jwakutumicila jwawo, kuti litamejepe pameso pawo kwa yaka yosope. Pakuŵa ŵaŵecete yeleyi ni Ŵalakwe AMBUJE Mlungu, myoyo liŵasa lya une jwakutumicila jwawo kweli tilicipocela upile mpaka kalakala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
